Mod 5 (mod5-automation-ic10)
----------------------------

The IC10 interpreter in mod5-automation-ic10/Ic10/ follows the IC10 programmable chip of
Stationeers closely, so that IC10 programs written for Stationeers run unchanged.
Ic10/Ic10StationeersTables.cs carries Stationeers' names and numbers for its logic types and
enums, and code comments name the Stationeers part each piece follows. The parts that follow
Stationeers are NOT covered by the MIT licence: they remain the property of RocketWerkz,
Stationeers' developer, and will be replaced by independently written code in a later release.

The IC Sorter's picture (anim/assets/StructureLogicSorter) includes the game's own straight
conveyor rail. That rail is Klei's art, is not covered by the MIT licence, and will be redrawn.

All Mod 5 art is placeholder art made with AI tools, to be replaced.

